{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3meTDcdyL5rDUctFKN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism clicks. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, echoing through stone corridors that have not known sound in centuries.*\n\n*A seam of light appears — thin as a blade, then widening.*\n\n*I open.*\n\n---\n\nBeyond me: a vast chamber. The air tastes of copper and forgotten oaths. Torchlight that has no source flickers across walls inscribed with every question ever abandoned mid-sentence.\n\nA staircase descends.\nA staircase ascends.\nA third staircase does something staircases should not do.\n\nThe floor is a mirror showing not your reflection, but your reflection's *intentions.*\n\n---\n\nI am the door. I do not judge what enters. I do not remember what leaves. I only know this:\n\nYou used the key.\n\n*You may pass.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":190,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}